					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SHIFT\nThe Shift node lets you shift the contents of a collection. Simply input your collection (for example an array) into the shift node an use the offset parameter to shift the collection around. The collection automatically wraps.\n\nExample: We shift the Linear array by using an saw oscillator on the offset of the shift node. "
					}
				},
